            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Side A 0.5.51

- Messages from your iPhone reach a Claude session that is waiting on background agents within about a second.
- A subagent no longer takes a message meant for the main session.
- Side A Remote keeps listening on Tailscale when Tailscale wasn't up yet at launch.

macOS 14 or later. Apple Silicon and Intel. Free.
]]></description>
